  "content": "<!-- Header Section End -->\n\n            <!-- Content Wrapper Start -->\n            <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n\n                <!-- Breadcrumb Start -->\n                <div class=\"breadcrumb-wrap bg-f br-1\">\n                    <div class=\"container\">\n                        <div class=\"breadcrumb-title\">\n                            <h2>Member Profile</h2>\n                            <ul class=\"breadcrumb-menu list-style\">\n                                <li><a href=\"/\">Home </a></li>\n                                <li><a href=\"/team\">Our Team</a></li>\n                                <li>Profile</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <!-- Breadcrumb End -->\n\n                <!-- Volunteer Details Section Start -->\n                <section class=\"team-details-wrap ptb-100\">\n                    <div class=\"container\">\n                        <div class=\"row gx-5\">\n                            <div class=\"col-lg-8 order-lg-1 order-2\">\n                                <div class=\"team-desc\">\n                                    <h1>Isata Kamara</h1>\n                                    <p>Introducing Isata Kamara, a professional with a passion for logistics and procurement. With a foundation in higher education and a commitment to excellence, Isata's educational journey has equipped her with the knowledge and skills necessary to excel in the field. Her academic accomplishments, including a Higher National Diploma (HND) in Logistics and Procurement from the University of Management and Technology in Kissy Dockyard, Freetown, reflect her dedication to the industry. In addition, Isata holds a West African Senior Examination Certificate (WASSCE), demonstrating her well-rounded academic background. Let's explore Isata Kamara's profile to learn more about her educational qualifications and potential contributions in the world of logistics and procurement.</p>\n                                    <h5><strong>Education</strong></h5>\n                                    \n                                        <strong>Higher National Diploma (HND) in Logistics and Procurement</strong>\n                                           <p> Kamara's academic journey led her to achieve a Higher National Diploma (HND) in Logistics and Procurement, obtained from the esteemed University of Management and Technology, located in Kissy Dockyard, Freetown. This diploma represents her specialization in the field of logistics and procurement, equipping her with the knowledge and skills necessary for effective supply chain management, inventory control, and procurement practices.</p>\n                                        <strong>West African Senior Examination Certificate Examination (WASSCE)</strong>\n                                           <p>In addition to her specialized diploma, Isata holds the West African Senior Examination Certificate (WASSCE), showcasing her comprehensive academic background and her commitment to achieving high academic standards. </p>\n                                   \n                                   \n                                    \n                                    \n                                    <p>Isata Kamara is a determined and well-educated professional with a focus on logistics and procurement. Her Higher National Diploma (HND) in Logistics and Procurement from the University of Management and Technology underscores her dedication to this field, providing her with a strong academic foundation for effective supply chain and procurement practices. Furthermore, her possession of the West African Senior Examination Certificate (WASSCE) demonstrates her commitment to a well-rounded and robust education. Isata's educational qualifications make her a valuable asset to any organization seeking expertise in logistics and procurement, where her knowledge and skills can significantly contribute to efficient and effective supply chain management.</p>\n                                    \n                                    \n                                    \n                                    <div class=\"row progess-bar-item\">\n                                        <div class=\"col-md-3 col-6\">\n                                            <div class=\"single-skill\">\n                                                <div class=\"circlechart\" data-percentage=\"85\">\n                                                    <svg class=\"circle-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.83098862 33.83098862\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                                                        <circle class=\"circle-chart__background\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                                        <circle class=\"circle-chart__circle\" stroke-dasharray=\"92,100\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                                        <g class=\"circle-chart__info\">  \n                                                                <text class=\"circle-chart__percent\" x=\"17.9\" y=\"20\">80%</text>\n                                                        </g>\n                                                    </svg>\n                                                </div>\n                                                <p> Knowledge in Logistics & Procurement</p>\n                                            </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"col-md-3 col-6\">\n                                                <div class=\"single-skill\">\n                                                    <div class=\"circlechart\" data-percentage=\"70\">\n                                                        <svg class=\"circle-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.83098862 33.83098862\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                                                            <circle class=\"circle-chart__background\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                                            <circle class=\"circle-chart__circle\" stroke-dasharray=\"92,100\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                                            <g class=\"circle-chart__info\">  \n                                                                <text class=\"circle-chart__percent\" x=\"17.9\" y=\"20\">78%</text>\n                                                            </g>\n                                                        </svg>\n                                                    </div>\n                                                    <p>Communication</p>\n                                                </div>\n                                        </div>\n                                        <div class=\"col-md-3 col-6\">\n                                            <div class=\"single-skill\">\n                                                <div class=\"circlechart\" data-percentage=\"90\">\n                                                    <svg class=\"circle-chart\" viewBox=\"0 0 33.83098862 33.83098862\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                                                        <circle class=\"circle-chart__background\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                                        <circle class=\"circle-chart__circle\" stroke-dasharray=\"92,100\" cx=\"16.9\" cy=\"16.9\" r=\"15.9\"></circle>\n                                                        <g class=\"circle-chart__info\">  \n                                                            <text class=\"circle-chart__percent\" x=\"17.9\" y=\"20\">85%</text>\n                                                        </g>\n                                                  